 Half is made to be fun for you, but also fun for everyone in the same room.", "short_description": "Half + Half is a multiplayer game about fun & connection. Glide or Swim through open-ended spaces. Play human tetris with friends, or Hide & Seek where you\u2019re two inches tall."}]}, "developer_name": "Normal", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nock.game/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://normcore.io/legal/termsofservice", "publisher_name": "Normal", "support_website_url": "https://halfandhalf.fun/", "website_url": "https://halfandhalf.fun/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "EXPLORATION", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1182036885870464"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982618_584224712380014_4012429186034565120_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ywxl-SSt2kYQ7kNvwFIjfJX&_nc_oc=Ado3OFUpr655DMy_qJfNCmahuLc52w36muAKtRPZKYauLF2pl4QI3inQlzIOKkBJihw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3NvybHfyQ4uYxEA42We2SOWzvQL9YR1LZ9MadlPLGGlw&oe=69F0B791"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Half + Half", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Hangout", "id": 